---
description: Proactively report important agent updates to IrisGreen
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the IrisGreen reporting instructions in `AGENTS.md` for this repository.
At the end of every conversation turn, project one short summary of that turn's
important information: outcomes, findings, blockers, and decisions. Write every
projected summary in English. Prefer
`report_expression` through the configured `irisgreen-status` MCP service, with
one stable session ID and no duration or ttl, so the message stays until the
next one replaces it. If that service is unavailable, project the same summary
on the device after connecting, and reuse the connection. Do not clear or
disconnect after each message. The display clears and disconnects after five
minutes without a successful projection. Never project secrets or private
reasoning. If neither path works, tell the user in chat instead of claiming the
wall showed the message.
